            <div class="step7-reading">
                <h2 class="step-title"><?php echo $_GET['archetype'];?> Archetype - Conclusion</h2>
                <p>Few archetypes will ever be as vulnerable to imbalance as the Explorer Archetype.  The Explorers fear of commitment and desire for freedom runs through their blood, yet the way that they live their lives tends to make them vulnerable to having to live a limited life either physically, emotionally, mentally or intimately.</p>
                <p>When the Explorer can stop running away from commitment, they can then use their ability to accomplish goals to create a way of committing that feels comfortable and sustainable to them. With it, the Explorer will have truly found a sense and experience of freedom that they would have never dreamt of in their wildest dreams.</p>
                <p>However, most Explorers will continue to avoid taking a more in-depth look in areas that do not initially inspire them - not realizing what they are missing and just how inspired they would be if they could experience their adventures in life holistically.</p>
                <img class="img-intext" src="/offer/paa/img/joy.png">
                <p>What you have read so far is just an introduction and a tiny portion of what we can tell you about The Explorer Archetype. It doesn’t matter where you are as an Explorer in your journey; whether you’ve already heard your ‘call to action’ and may have started to implement the changes you must make to overcome your greatest challenge.  Whether you’ve already achieved a sense of ‘contribution.’  Or whether you have found this report to be eye-opening from the offset. </p>
                <p>The thing is, we ‘get you,’ we know your call to action or your greatest challenge, we know the lessons you have to learn and how you might respond to them, and if you felt as though we understood you, that was because we do.</p>
                <p>We know how to help you to uncover and reconcile the hidden aspects of your ‘self’ so that when you do, all internal conflict fades away and what is left behind is a balanced, whole and strong individual who can navigate life on their terms while connecting with the right people deeply.</p>
                <p>We have spent years understanding the Explorer Archetype, and have built on and adapted Jung’s work to ensure that you achieve great success in your quest for liberation.</p>
                <p>We continue to learn more about you and update our content as you send in your life stories and experiences.</p>
                <p>Slowly and surely, we have understood how the Explorer thinks, relates and connects.  Why they do what they do and what they need to discover to reach their full potential.</p>
                <p>This is how we know that many of the challenges you’ve faced and will face in the future have been and can be reconciled, even if you cannot see how at this moment in time. </p>
                <p>But to reconcile your ‘self,’ YOU need to understand more about yourself. You need to discover your little (and big) traits so that you can understand them, accept them and work with them, or change them (if they do not serve you). </p>
                <p>Life is fleeting, and you don’t have to live your life in conflict and disruption because of your disdain for freedom. You don’t have to stand idly by, watching others make the changes to the world that you are so capable of doing.  You can make changes in the world, and you can learn to bring about change without feeling trapped by limitation. You just need to learn how.</p>
                <p>To learn how, you need to go much deeper into your psyche, and start to uncover the secrets that you keep even from yourself, you need to learn about the secret lives of your unexpressed world and understand how your underworld can cause conflict in your reality - and then you need to learn how to reconcile it.</p>
                <p>Once you’ve learned about your hidden self, you need to protect your newly found sense of wholeness.  You can do this by learning how hidden forces influenced by timing, affect different phases of your life, forces that are seeking to achieve wholeness and are prompting you to reconcile parts of yourself so that you can feel complete; this is all part of the process of individuation.</p>
                <p>Most people don’t realize that these forces exist and then when they walk into problems in later life they are completely mystified as to how the new challenges they face came about! </p>
                <p>If you can develop an awareness of these factors and build strategies into your life by reconciling them as part of the individuation process, you will be able to conquer your shadows before them conquering you. </p>
                <p>The Premium Archetypal Analysis will help you develop an awareness of the depths of your soul, and it’s needs, and then it presents you with coping strategies and resources to help you satisfy your deepest desires so that you feel utterly fulfilled.</p>
                <p>Are you ready to learn what really drives you as an Explorer? What secretly motivates and inspires you? And what you are afraid of? </p>
                <p>Are you ready to learn how you can unlock your true potential, while also staying true to who you are?</p>
                <p>But here’s the caveat, It’s not for everyone – you need to be willing to challenge yourself, to face your fears, you’ll need to admit to parts of yourself that you may not pride yourself in, and to ask and answer questions you haven’t asked yourself before.</p>
                <p>But if you do this, then you start to accept all of yourself, or you’ll find the resources to make the changes that you feel that you need to make so that you can accept yourself and then with that acceptance, you start to grow, and steer your life to one that you have only ever imagined before.</p>
                <p>The Premium Archetypal Analysis is not a quick-fix solution, nor an easy shortcut.  But it will present you with the keys to unlocking your ‘self’ and finding out who you are, and then it will help you create a road-map for creating who you want to be in the future - realistically without any hidden forces driving you in the wrong direction.
                <p>Are you ready to go deeper than you've ever gone before?</p>
